  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a name=\"top\"></a></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"> <p><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/u.gif\" width=\"24\">O. \n                            Combat&amp;Jobs</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:60%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"22\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"590\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background.gif\">\n<p><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"\" bordercolor=\"#999933\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"530\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" class=\"heading\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"25\" width=\"524\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ \n                                            지능평가 </span></font></b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"heading\" height=\"27\" width=\"444\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬 구동시 상대방의 지능(마력)설명</span></b></font></p></td>\n<td class=\"heading\" height=\"27\" width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">상대방의 마력</span></b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"27\" width=\"444\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그는 \n                                            돌머리 수준을 벗어났지만 아직 밥통이야.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"27\" width=\"95\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">0*</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"27\" width=\"444\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"(그/그녀/그것)은 \n                                            돌보다 약간 멍청해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"27\" width=\"95\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">1-9</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"27\" width=\"444\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"(그/그녀/그것)은 \n                                            좀 멍청해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"27\" width=\"95\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">10-19</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"27\" width=\"444\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"(그/그녀/그것)은 \n                                            전혀 똑똑해 보이지 않습니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"27\" width=\"95\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">20-29</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"27\" width=\"444\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"(그/그녀/그것)은 \n                                            평균 지능은 가진것으로 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"27\" width=\"95\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">30-39</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"27\" width=\"444\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"(그/그녀/그것)은 \n                                            보통 지능을 가진것으로 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"27\" width=\"95\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">40-49</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"27\" width=\"444\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"(그/그녀/그것)은 \n                                            높은 지능을 가진것으로 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"27\" width=\"95\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">50-59</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"27\" width=\"444\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"(그/그녀/그것)은 \n                                            아주 높은 지능을 가진것으로 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"27\" width=\"95\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">60-69</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"27\" width=\"444\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"(그/그녀/그것)은 \n                                            엄청나게 높은 지능을 가진것으로 \n                                            보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"27\" width=\"95\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">70-79</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"27\" width=\"444\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"(그/그녀/그것)은 \n                                            경이로운 지능을 가진것으로 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"27\" width=\"95\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">80-89</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"27\" width=\"444\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"(그/그녀/그것)은 \n                                            천재라고 할만한 지능을 가진것으로 \n                                            보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"27\" width=\"95\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">90-99</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"27\" width=\"444\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"(그/그녀/그것)은 \n                                            당신이 감히 알수 없을 만큼 높은 \n                                            지능을 가진것으로</span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">보입니다.\"</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"27\" width=\"95\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">100+</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"comment\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"543\"> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ \n                                            지능평가 실패시에는 \"당신은 \n                                            (그/그녀/그것)의 정신적인 능력을 \n                                            알&nbsp;수 없습니다\"라는</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">메시지를 \n                                            보게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ 이벨은 마법공격시 메저리와 \n                                            함께 마법공격의 데미지를 높여주는 역할을 합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">즉 \n                                            상대방의 마법저항을 무시하여 데미지를 \n                                            높게 하는 역할 합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">그러므로 마법공격위주 플레이어는 \n\n            이벨은 필수적 스킬입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이벨스킬 76이상부터 상대방의 \n\n                        마나의 현 상태가 표시됩니다</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"</span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이 \n                                            대상의 정신력은 100퍼센트입니다.\"</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> <br></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이표시는 상대방의 마나가 100%로 \n\n                        차있다는 표시입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">바론이나 마법 공격의 몬스터를 \n\n                        잡을시 이스킬을 구동하여 강한 몬스터의</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">마나가 0%상태일 때 8써클 마법인 \n\n                        에너지 볼텍스를 구동하여 적을 보다 쉽게 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">제압하실 수 있습니다</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">*실제적으로 \n                                            마나가 0을 가진 생물체는 없습니다. \n                                            </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">즉, \n                                            무생물(상자나 돌 등등)에서 이러한 \n                                            메시지를 보게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"298\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:8;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_skill/\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/menu.gif\" width=\"30\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"295\">\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"#top\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/top.gif\" width=\"20\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Written By Forg</span></b></font></p>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_b.gif\" height=\"20\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/b_logo.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n"
}
